cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AQ26 outputs, cite the specific governed release and its PUBLIC_RELEASE_MANIFEST.json as well as this repository."
title: "AQ26 England Air Quality Observatory"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SCC Nexus Data"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sccnexusdata/AQ26-England-Observatory"
url: "https://github.com/sccnexusdata/AQ26-England-Observatory"
abstract: >-
  Public evidence, methodology and reproducibility surface for an independent,
  England-wide air-quality and environmental evidence observatory. AQ26 combines
  official monitoring observations with meteorological, emissions, satellite,
  modelled and contextual evidence under explicit provenance and scientific-claim
  controls.
keywords:
  - air quality
  - environmental monitoring
  - England
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
  - atmospheric science
license: "NOASSERTION"
